{"4152140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hattu: Ancient War", "steam_appid": 4152140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RULE YOUR KINGDOM THROUGH DIPLOMACY, STRATEGY, AND WAR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Hattu: Ancient War</i>, every decision shapes the borders of your realm. Send messages to rival kings, negotiate alliances, issue threats, demand tribute, or declare total war. Your words become actions on the map — and your rivals react to every move you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152140/extras/4f0e4e857a2d01ac85f311e1636e67f9.poster.avif?t=1764539722\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152140/extras/4f0e4e857a2d01ac85f311e1636e67f9.webm?t=1764539722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152140/extras/4f0e4e857a2d01ac85f311e1636e67f9.mp4?t=1764539722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NEGOTIATE, THREATEN, OR DECEIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speak to neighboring rulers through your envoy.<br>Craft offers, warnings, demands, or subtle traps.<br>Some leaders respect strength, others fear it, and others wait for a moment to betray you.<br>How you communicate determines whether you gain allies… or enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHEN DIPLOMACY FAILS, ARMIES DECIDE THE OUTCOME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If negotiations collapse, conflict is resolved instantly based on your kingdom’s strength, alliances, and strategic position.<br>Secure borders, expand territory, and outmaneuver rivals before they outmaneuver you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHAPE YOUR REALM ACROSS A LIVING STRATEGIC MAP</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and claim hex-based territories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control mountain passes and river crossings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your capital</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for betrayal or surprise alliances<br>Every campaign unfolds differently as rulers respond to your choices.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVERY MESSAGE CREATES A NEW STORY OF POWER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No rival reacts the same way twice.<br>Some respect honor, others prefer intimidation, and ambitious rulers wait for the perfect moment to strike.<br>Your journey is shaped by diplomacy, strategy, and the consequences of your own decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RULE YOUR KINGDOM THROUGH DIPLOMACY, STRATEGY, AND WAR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Hattu: Ancient War</i>, every decision shapes the borders of your realm. Send messages to rival kings, negotiate alliances, issue threats, demand tribute, or declare total war. Your words become actions on the map — and your rivals react to every move you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152140/extras/4f0e4e857a2d01ac85f311e1636e67f9.poster.avif?t=1764539722\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152140/extras/4f0e4e857a2d01ac85f311e1636e67f9.webm?t=1764539722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152140/extras/4f0e4e857a2d01ac85f311e1636e67f9.mp4?t=1764539722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NEGOTIATE, THREATEN, OR DECEIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speak to neighboring rulers through your envoy.<br>Craft offers, warnings, demands, or subtle traps.<br>Some leaders respect strength, others fear it, and others wait for a moment to betray you.<br>How you communicate determines whether you gain allies… or enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHEN DIPLOMACY FAILS, ARMIES DECIDE THE OUTCOME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If negotiations collapse, conflict is resolved instantly based on your kingdom’s strength, alliances, and strategic position.<br>Secure borders, expand territory, and outmaneuver rivals before they outmaneuver you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHAPE YOUR REALM ACROSS A LIVING STRATEGIC MAP</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and claim hex-based territories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control mountain passes and river crossings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your capital</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for betrayal or surprise alliances<br>Every campaign unfolds differently as rulers respond to your choices.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVERY MESSAGE CREATES A NEW STORY OF POWER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No rival reacts the same way twice.<br>Some respect honor, others prefer intimidation, and ambitious rulers wait for the perfect moment to strike.<br>Your journey is shaped by diplomacy, strategy, and the consequences of your own decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Lead kings through strategy and diplomacy. Use negotiation, deception, or intimidation to claim supremacy war is only one path.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152140/d975297f0fb45ffd28a181a016e1a86655975564/header.jpg?t=1764539722", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4152140/db42587c685f0b645b9fb